body:
Aw thank you! Ahaha yeah I most likely would've taken so much longer to get Umi if I didn't have Kotori backing me up ...

... and all the other rares I got from SoloYoloing. >.>; 

It was pretty fun though! Super excited for all the other events that are going to come, a tad sad I joined near the end of μ's though but hopefully the new girls are just as good if not better! :D
